          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "4129bcf4",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p style=\"text-align:right;font-size:13px;color:#999;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;margin-bottom:24px;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE — e.g. 1 June 2026]</strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">1. Business Details</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;font-family:Inter,sans-serif;\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;width:38%;font-weight:600;\">Legal Name</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">Brand Name</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">Burans Valley</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">Registered Office</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[FULL ADDRESS, UTTARAKHAND, PIN]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">FSSAI Licence No.</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[14-DIGIT FSSAI NUMBER]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">GSTIN</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[15-CHARACTER GSTIN]</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#F2F5F2;\"><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">Customer Care</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[EMAIL] | [PHONE / WhatsApp]</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;font-weight:600;\">Website</td><td style=\"padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #DDE5DD;\">[YOUR DOMAIN]</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;margin-top:36px;\">2. Acceptance</h2>\n<p>By using this website and purchasing our products, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use this website.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">3. Products</h2>\n<p>Burans Valley sells A2 Desi Cow Bilona Ghee and related products made from Uttarakhand-sourced milk. All products are food items subject to FSSAI regulations. The physical label takes precedence over website descriptions.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">4. Ordering & Pricing</h2>\n<ul><li>All prices are in INR, <strong>inclusive of GST</strong>.</li><li>Shipping charges (if any) are shown before payment.</li><li>We may correct pricing errors and will notify you before proceeding.</li><li>Acceptance occurs at dispatch, not order confirmation.</li></ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">5. Payment</h2>\n<p>We accept payments via <strong>[PAYMENT GATEWAY]</strong> — UPI, Net Banking, Cards, Wallets. COD availability is shown at checkout. We do not store payment card details.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">6. Returns & Refunds</h2>\n<p>See our <a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a>. Returns are accepted only for damaged or incorrect items within 48 hours of delivery.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">7. Shipping</h2>\n<p>See our <a href=\"/shipping-policy\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Shipping &amp; Delivery Policy</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">8. Intellectual Property</h2>\n<p>All content — name, logo, images, text — is the property of [YOUR LEGAL COMPANY NAME] and protected under Indian IP law. No reproduction without written permission.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>\n<p>Health content on our blog is for general information only. See our <a href=\"/disclaimer\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Disclaimer</a>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">10. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>Our total liability for any claim shall not exceed the value of the relevant order.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">11. Governing Law</h2>\n<p>These Terms are governed by Indian law. Disputes are subject to the courts at <strong>[YOUR CITY / STATE]</strong>.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">12. Grievances</h2>\n<p>See our <a href=\"/grievance-redressal\" style=\"color:#1B3B2B;font-weight:500;\">Grievance Redressal page</a> (Consumer Protection E-Commerce Rules 2020).</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Playfair Display,serif;color:#1B3B2B;\">13. Changes</h2>\n<p>We may update these Terms at any time. The date above reflects the latest version.</p>\n",
